## 5. Directory Architecture (v7.5)
- `core/`: High-priority engines (`kibot_manager.py`, `kibot_engine_v2.py`).
- `scanners/`: Signal detectors for multiple exchanges.
- `tools/`: Diagnostic and validation scripts (e.g., `test_offline.py`).
- `infra/`: System configurations and deployment installers.
- `state/`: Critical persistence files (`daily_state.json`).
